- removed telemetry (Application Insights) and every call to KX-hosted services;
- removed kdb Insights Enterprise support (connections, data sources, UDAs,
  scratchpads, the query editor, meta views, OAuth sign-in);
- removed the KDB-X welcome/installer, newsletter, survey and Help & Feedback links;
- removed the qlint build-tool integration (a separately licensed KX component);
- renamed the extension, its command ids, setting keys, view ids and titles,
  and replaced the KX logos with neutral placeholders.

